            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>• 8,000 mg of VERISOL® Collagen</strong><br/><br/>Contains VERISOL® bioactive collagen peptides, which have been clinically studied to support skin health and maintain skin elasticity.</p><p><strong>• Adaptogenic Maca Root</strong><br/><br/>Traditionally used in South American medicine to support vitality and help the body adapt to stress, including during times of hormonal change.</p><p><strong>• White Grape Seed Extract</strong><br/><br/>A source of antioxidants that helps reduce free radical damage and supports general health and wellbeing. Has been studied for its potential to support skin and cardiovascular health during menopause.</p><p><strong>• Cultavit® Activated B-Complex</strong><br/><br/>Provides activated B vitamins that support energy production, assist with healthy stress response, and contribute to normal cognitive and skin function.</p><p><strong>• Magnesium Lactate</strong><br/><br/>Supports nervous system function and muscle health. May help reduce muscle cramps and support healthy sleep patterns.</p><p><strong>• Vitamin C</strong><br/><br/>Supports collagen formation, contributes to healthy immune system function, and helps reduce free radical damage to body cells.</p><p><strong>• Vitamin D3</strong><br/><br/>Supports bone health, immune system function, and assists in the regulation of calcium metabolism. May help maintain healthy mood balance.</p><p><strong>• EpiBright™</strong><br/><br/>A botanical complex containing plant-based antioxidants. Antioxidants help reduce free radicals formed in the body and support skin health.</p>",
